I left out both operations requests. The node's `with Clock` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` needs filesystem authority, and fetching from the metadata service needs HTTP authority. Neither is granted, so the world imports neither. The output is unchanged. If you want them, the graph needs to grant those capabilities to this node.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{tick, run-info};

    import wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0;

    export run: func(tick: tick) -> run-info;
}
```

